==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|BREAKpoint|Sudowoodo|67}} from the {{TCG|BREAKpoint}} expansion.
*'''Fight Back''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Platinum|Vigoroth|64}} from the {{TCG|Platinum}} expansion.
